        "subject": "LU-21079 mdd: clear orphan changelog record at user endrec",
        "message": "LU-21079 mdd: clear orphan changelog record at user endrec\n\nChangelog records up to and including a user's endrec are purgeable,\nbut the mount time orphan check only treats a first record strictly\nbelow the smallest user endrec as an orphan. If a GC thread purge is\ninterrupted by umount after it removed all but the record at endrec,\nthat record is never cleaned up at the next mount.\n\nTreat a first record equal to the smallest user endrec as an orphan\nas well. An empty changelog must still be skipped explicitly.\n\nFixes: c7d8fe310649 (\"LU-14731 mdd: clear orphans changelog entries\")\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I4483d60880d3322f9fe6e271bf51f36001eed426\n"
      },
